            "principleType": "physical_law",
            "surfaceIllusion": "All witnesses insist the victim was seen in the garden precisely at a quarter past two, as confirmed by the sundial’s shadow.",
            "underlyingReality": "A sudden but brief cloud cover erased the sundial’s shadow at exactly a quarter past two, making the shadow’s presence impossible at that moment; the victim’s presence must be re-timed.",
