            "Mechanical clocks and sundials are relied upon but subject to environmental and mechanical limitations.",
            "Weather conditions such as overcast skies and drizzle affect visibility and sound, preserving physical clues but obscuring natural time markers."
          ],
          "emotionalRegister": "A pervasive tension tinged with guarded resilience and an undercurrent of unease colors daily life at the estate.",
